WEBVTT

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:30.500
Jesus...

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.580
Woohoo! Y'all ready for this?

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:40.790
Alrighty. Let's get to invadin'!

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.500
We're gonna have a real whale of a time!

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.710
About time to find food...

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:56.420
I've had it up to HERE with you!

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:57.830
We're done! I'm going home!

00:00:57.830 --> 00:00:59.290
What's all the fuss about?
C'mon, Shinobu! It's just a misunderstanding!

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.170
I already know you've got
your eyes on other girls, Ataru!

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:03.250
So go cry to them!

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.040
Don't be ridiculous!

00:01:04.380 --> 00:01:05.880
I swear on my life...

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:07.420
that my heart belongs to you
and you alone!

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.380
Wh-whatever, you're just
trying to sweet talk me.

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:14.830
No, I'm not.
I've always felt this way about you.

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:17.880
Fine, but this is your last chance, okay?

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:23.080
What a looker!

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.460
You didn't even last 5 seconds...

00:01:25.130 --> 00:01:26.830
I hate you, Ataru...

00:01:26.830 --> 00:01:28.250
YOU'RE THE WORST!

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.420
I totally blew it!

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:34.710
Aw, jeez.

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:37.250
What's so bad about taking
a quick look at other ladies?

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:40.790
Hold it right there, young man!

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:40.790
DASH DASH

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.750
You mustn't throw your life away!

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:45.580
You have to stay strong and keep it together!

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:45.170
Wait

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.830
WHAM!

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.460
What the hell?!

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:51.460
It's freezing!
Oh no... I was too late.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:52.250
Oh no... I was too late.

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:53.880
Rest in peace.

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:56.080
Whaddya do that for?

00:01:55.750 --> 00:02:03.790
Beware of

00:01:55.750 --> 00:02:03.790
Molesters!

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:58.290
Wait, you weren't about to
jump off the bridge?

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:01.130
But I'm certain I saw the
shadow of death looming over you.

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:03.170
That's why I ran in to try and help.

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:03.790
Yeowch!
That's why I ran in to try and help.

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:06.920
Hah! I'd never give up on life
just because a girl dumped me!

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.130
Y-young man...

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:10.170
What is it?

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:11.830
That face of yours!

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:14.790
It's an absolute disaster!

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:18.670
Sorry, that came out wrong.

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:22.040
What I'm trying to say is that your
physical features indicate very bad luck...

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:24.630
Who even are you? Get off my case.

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:27.790
I'm the traveling monk Sakuranbo,
AKA "Cherry".

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.210
I'm sure our meeting will prove most FRUITful!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.210
Traveling Monk

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.210
Sakuranbo

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:30.210
AKA "Cherry"

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:34.130
You better not be following me around
just to tell crappy jokes like that, old man!

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:35.290
Ataru!

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.170
Ataru!

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.130
Hey Mom, hey Shinobu.
What's got you two in a big hurry?

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:41.380
I've been worried sick about you
ever since I heard the news!

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:42.830
What news?

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:45.580
He's over here!

00:02:45.580 --> 00:02:46.710
What the?

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:48.710
You're Mr. Ataru Moroboshi, is that right?

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:51.920
These gentlemen are from the government!
They've been looking for you!

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.130
What for, exactly...?

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:57.500
Listen, Ataru.
Just stay calm and don't freak out.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.920
Freak out? But I have no idea what's...

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.920
Moroboshi

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.250
Hey!

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.920
Welcome home, boyo!

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:08.130
Oni!

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:10.670
Begone demon! Begone demon!

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:12.330
Whoa, simmer down.
Begone demon! Begone demon!

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.790
'Fraid I'm not going anywhere, boyo.
We're invaders, ya see!

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:19.130
Come have a seat.
We got somethin' to talk to ya about.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.500
S-sure...

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:24.040
We'll be positioned over
the target momentarily.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.920
Prepare the transporter for
energy-matter conversion.

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:28.500
We've just gotten word that contact has
been established with the target.

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.710
You're saying I gotta fight
against alien invaders?!

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:33.210
As part of their invasion of Earth,

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.540
these aliens have asked us
to agree to one condition.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:39.330
We wanna compete in a showdown against
a random human that our computer picks.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.420
And if we happen to lose...

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:43.170
then we'll give up and go home!

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:45.500
And I'm the human the computer picked?

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.500
That's right!

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:47.330
No way!

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.880
Ataru doesn't stand a chance
fighting against Oni!

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.790
He would end up dead!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.710
Wh-what she said! Begone demon!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.290
Oh pshaw! It's time to take the Oni
by the horns, boyo!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:58.540
Because we're challenging you...
to an old fashioned game of tag!

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.460
Tag? Like the kid's game?

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:10.500
What's the big idea?!

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:13.420
Hey! We been waitin' for ya!

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:21.420
So...

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:24.920
I take it this guy is my opponent?

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:27.540
Hi. The name's Lum.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:30.500
This here is my daughter!

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:31.750
Ain't she just a beaut?

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.500
Anywho, let me explain
the rules of the game.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:36.420
You're gonna be "it" and you've got 10 days to
beat Lum by grabbing both of her horns.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:38.670
So, I have to play tag with her?

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:39.670
Okay then.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:42.380
But I'm not gonna be able to grab her horns
without grabbing her body first...

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:43.250
Hey!

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.500
You're not gonna get your
hands on me that easily.

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:46.830
That's what you think!

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:49.170
I'm gonna be holding you tight
in my arms by the time we're done!

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:50.460
Ataru, a moment please?

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:52.250
You degenerate!

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:55.880
Young Moroboshi!
The fate of the Earth is in your hands!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.960
This is serious business.
Everyone's counting on me.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.170
I'll do it!

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.250
Woohoo! Now we're talkin'!

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:03.750
The game will start tomorrow!

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:05.830
A big ol' showdown with Earth on the line!

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:08.420
And it's gonna be an absolute blast!

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:42.460
Okay, folks! Humanity is about to
face aliens in a game of tag

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.920
Young Love on the Run

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.460
that will decide the fate of the planet!

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:48.080
The time limit is 10 days.
From sunup to sundown!

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:51.040
Representing Earth is high schooler
Ataru Moroboshi from Tokyo.

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:54.830
Humanity will emerge victorious if he manages to
grab hold of the horns on Invader Lum's head.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.250
Earth Rules!

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.250
Give It All You've Got

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.250
Beat Those Aliens

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:54.250
You Can Do It

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:58.420
But if Lum can keep him at bay until
time runs out, then Earth will be invaded!

